    "body": "> Should we also add an example where we have a size check before assignment?\r\n\r\nYeah, I think so. This is my first attempt at an example, but I'm not exactly sure if this is the best way to go about it is.\r\n\r\nMore contex form #509:\r\n\r\n> I think I would prefer a two-step algorithm over handling a size mismatch inline, though I cannot really fault the English.\r\n\r\nDoes the added not and example sufficiently emphasize this?",
